    "words": "雖然我們把它逼到了這個地步……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 128811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "怜",
    "words": "\\n但是對方的狀態",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 128811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "怜",
    "words": "也跟一開始差很多呢。",
